<div>
  <div class="bm-hero-94__container">
    <div class="bm-hero-94__content">
      <h1 class="bm-hero-94__heading">Long headline to turn your visitors into customers</h1>
      <p class="bm-hero-94__subheading">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua.</p>
